# Removing Outliers

This project demonstrates how to identify and remove outliers from a dataset using Python and statistical methods.

## 📌 Objective

The main objective of this project is to:

- Identify outliers in numerical data
- Understand how outliers affect data analysis
- Remove unwanted extreme values
- Compare data before and after removing outliers

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Statistics

## 📊 Topics Covered

- Mean
- Median
- Standard Deviation
- Quartiles
- IQR (Interquartile Range)
- Outlier Detection
- Outlier Removal
- Data Visualization

## 🔍 Outlier Detection using IQR

The Interquartile Range (IQR) method is used to detect outliers.

### Formula

```text
IQR = Q3 - Q1

Lower Bound = Q1 - 1.5 × IQR

Upper Bound = Q3 + 1.5 × IQR
